    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517850/extras/3ba95ab11d81e84271fb3b6b08a0099d.avif?t=1749230219\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Quickie: A Love Hotel Story</i></strong> is fundamentally a tale of love \u2665</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The tale unfolds through eight different love stories, each brimming with romance and consensual eroticism. The wholesome and enjoyable narratives are enriched by steamy, hand-painted artwork and animated with dedication and care.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>So\u2026 which love story will you pick?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517850/extras/ec752b0368b243efac825e358d6fd851.avif?t=1749230219\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517850/extras/fdae5a56bb7d263b3c4c60125f675b23.poster.avif?t=1749230219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517850/extras/fdae5a56bb7d263b3c4c60125f675b23.webm?t=1749230219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517850/extras/fdae5a56bb7d263b3c4c60125f675b23.mp4?t=1749230219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by the Persona Series, immerse yourself in a linear visual novel experience where you meet and date 8 stunning women! Journey with them through their personal stories, discovering their personalities and the obstacles they face as your romance flourishes. But there can only be one choice... <strong>who will you choose to end your Love Hotel Story?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517850/extras/8eaed86451419ab6a284fd89ea4b4eb0.avif?t=1749230219\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517850/extras/a0c5fe997a7406c218d2e7bd189999f9.poster.avif?t=1749230219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517850/extras/a0c5fe997a7406c218d2e7bd189999f9.webm?t=1749230219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517850/extras/a0c5fe997a7406c218d2e7bd189999f9.mp4?t=1749230219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Indulge in a wide array of stunningly animated h-scenes, complete with sensual moaning and erotic sound effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517850/extras/4552587e0e816a3c34c18b9b3dd3938c.avif?t=1749230219\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517850/extras/7b3abd0e0711dcbe7b93b8c71bf72a06.poster.avif?t=1749230219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517850/extras/7b3abd0e0711dcbe7b93b8c71bf72a06.webm?t=1749230219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517850/extras/7b3abd0e0711dcbe7b93b8c71bf72a06.mp4?t=1749230219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build, upgrade and customize your love hotel to earn hotel stars, enabling you to grow your hotel empire throughout the city of Tokyo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517850/extras/4dff3c18f6a463338d48f943dca200ec.avif?t=1749230219\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517850/extras/fbaf491e51900167b1712684b1767a6a.poster.avif?t=1749230219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517850/extras/fbaf491e51900167b1712684b1767a6a.webm?t=1749230219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517850/extras/fbaf491e51900167b1712684b1767a6a.mp4?t=1749230219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you expand your hotel, invite love interests into the hotel to deepen your bond more intimately! Gain access to the special Fantasy Suites and discover enchanting, sensual experiences with each of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517850/extras/b2de232137b77c4da3e29c7cf452cc3e.avif?t=1749230219\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517850/extras/a12cb5e388a5607f85564623b39a3359.poste